{"4662030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unearthly", "steam_appid": 4662030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4814380], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662030/extras/93e94eb13053920cdd311382612d0f60.poster.avif?t=1787706598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662030/extras/93e94eb13053920cdd311382612d0f60.webm?t=1787706598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662030/extras/93e94eb13053920cdd311382612d0f60.mp4?t=1787706598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearthly</strong> is an action game with light ARPG elements where you build your own alien and wreak havoc across humanity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of <strong>weapons and origins</strong> to create your alien, then take control of the battlefield with brutal, physics-driven combat. <strong>Smash through enemies to send them flying, grab multiple enemies at once, and hurl them into their allies</strong> to knock entire groups off their feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your next target from the <strong>world map</strong> and take on randomized missions with different objectives and bonuses. Complete missions to gather <strong>stat crystals</strong> that can be applied to any ability, letting you customize your build and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then head back to the world map, choose your next mission, and do it all again, <strong>taking on greater challenges as your alien becomes increasingly powerful.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete missions. Grow stronger. Take on the next.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662030/extras/88c305133d682db5c3f07072e40f13c1.poster.avif?t=1787706598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662030/extras/88c305133d682db5c3f07072e40f13c1.webm?t=1787706598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662030/extras/88c305133d682db5c3f07072e40f13c1.mp4?t=1787706598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn enemies into weapons</strong>!  Grab and throw them into each other, or smash through entire groups and send them flying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete missions, grow stronger, and repeat!</strong>  Choose randomized missions from the world map, collect upgrades and resources, then take your stronger build into the next fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your playstyle</strong> by mixing and matching <strong>10 weapons and 8 origins</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No long campaign,</strong> jump straight into randomized missions and objectives from the world map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend less time managing loot</strong> with automatic pickups and quick salvaging aboard your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push abilities beyond their limits</strong> by altering fully upgraded abilities with powerful new effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your build</strong> with a massive passive skill tree featuring <strong>over 200 passives</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own alien</strong> with an assortment of heads, suits, and colors to mix and match.</p></li